Market Growth Drivers & Opportunities
The low-code development platform market is experiencing rapid growth, fueled by the increasing demand for rapid application development and the need for businesses to stay competitive in a fast-paced digital landscape. Low-code platforms enable organizations to develop applications with minimal hand-coding, reducing development time and costs while empowering non-technical users to contribute to the development process.
